Ok, left vertical spacing as-is in this change. Updated horizontal to not change the default behavior but instead provide an opt-in in `tui.json` like so:

```json
{
  "prompt": {
    "max_width": "auto"
  }
}
// Resolves to max(75, floor(terminal_width * 0.7)).
```

or `"auto"` can instead be a fixed width.

@andrewesweet ur issue did say this:
> Wire up gemini-3.5-flash via a custom provider entry — OpenCode 1.15.4 doesn't ship the model natively, so it has to be added through opencode's custom provider config.


Are u using the native google vertex provider? Gemini 3.5 flash is included for that
